# `filter(xs) as U[]`, `xs.slice(0) as U[]`: a call reads as a value of no type. Where the callee is certain before flow (the one closure of an immutable binding, a member of a built-in that start-up locks on a receiver of that class), its declaration says that the object is an array, so the assertion is no source and the place behind it keeps its type and its test.
# A binding that may be assigned again, a receiver that is only predicted to be an array, and a callee whose own result admits objects leave the assertion, or the call, a source
# FORM: AsRead
# RUN: pass AdmitAssertedObjects
# STATISTIC: PositionsAdmittingObjects = 4

module m0 path="main.ts" displayPath="main.ts" body=f0
typesite w0 module=m0 position=10 kind=Result
typesite w1 module=m0 position=20 kind=Assertion
typesite w2 module=m0 position=30 kind=Variable
typesite w3 module=m0 position=40 kind=Parameter
variable g0 name="filter" module=m0 declared={type=function flags=[IsFromCompiler]} initialization=Function function=f1 flags=[IsImmutable]
variable g1 name="replaceable" module=m0 declared={type=anything} initialization=Undefined
variable g2 name="fromCertainCallee" module=m0 declared={type=undefined|null|Array predicted=Array site=w2} initialization=Undefined
variable g3 name="fromReplaceableCallee" module=m0 declared={type=undefined|null|Array predicted=Array site=w2} initialization=Undefined
variable g4 name="fromBuiltin" module=m0 declared={type=undefined|null|Array predicted=Array site=w2} initialization=Undefined
variable g5 name="fromPredictedReceiver" module=m0 declared={type=undefined|null|Array predicted=Array site=w2} initialization=Undefined
variable g6 name="passesOn" module=m0 declared={type=function flags=[IsFromCompiler]} initialization=Function function=f2 flags=[IsImmutable]
variable g7 name="fromCalleeThatPassesOn" module=m0 declared={type=undefined|null|Array predicted=Array site=w2} initialization=Undefined
